{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The agent's per-turn tool budget. Reads TOOL_BUDGET from runtime/agent/botd.properties (system.apps.agent.runtime — the same boot-time snapshot chat_llm reads LLM= from, so an edit takes effect on the next service restart, not live). TOOL_BUDGET=<positive integer>; absent, zero, negative, or non-numeric falls back to the default of 10, and the value is capped at 1000 as a guard. Returns FLAT {budget: i64}. The agentloop js reads this once at ready and uses it as the chatTurn round limit in place of the hard-coded 10.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\n","params":[],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"vpiuwl1a0b6b267c5p2fd","readers":[],"time":1789771560476,"username":"system","writers":[]}